     {"issue": "The disclaimer of responsibility for contractors' acts must be read against the Agreements of Release, whose defined \"Released Parties\" list (officers, trustees, agents, staff, employees, volunteers, interns) does not include contractors, and against the Decision-Making bullet, which treats contractors' decisions as part of the program. The instrument thus treats contractors as both inside and outside the NOLS program.", "type": 2, "prob": 0.28}
